			"notes": "# CubeCraft+ 1.3.0\n\nA friends list, a lobby chest finder, silent auto voting and Minecraft 26.3 support.\n\n## What's new\n\n### Friends list\nSee who's online and what they're playing, then message, party invite or remove friends in one click. Open it with `/ccp friends` or a keybind.\n(Friends list might take some time to load on first open)\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"2026-09-23_15 17 59\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a8ccba11-5e97-4b2f-9d16-deeecb5be0f7\" />\n\n### Lobby chest finder\nFinds the hidden lobby chest, posts its location in chat and highlights it through walls.\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"2026-09-22_23 40 06\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6acdcbf9-c601-4965-9e88-6033433196ce\" />\n\n### Silent auto vote\nVotes in the background without opening the voting menus. SkyWars' new Advanced chests option is supported too.\n\n### Update notifications\nGet a message in chat when a new version is out, or check with `/ccp version`.\n\n### Also new\n- Keybinds for the settings and friends list (Controls → Key Binds → CubeCraft+)\n- Open the settings from Mod Menu\n- Settings split into General, Auto Vote and Cubepanion tabs\n- Lobby player counts are shared with Cubepanion (can be turned off)\n- New logo\n\n## Fixes\n- Leaderboards sent to Cubepanion are linked to the right game\n- Features only run while you're on CubeCraft\n\n## Download\n\n| Minecraft | File |\n|---|---|\n| 26.3 | `cubecraft-plus-1.3.0+26.3.jar` |\n| 26.2 | `cubecraft-plus-1.3.0+26.2.jar` |\n| 26.1 | `cubecraft-plus-1.3.0+26.1.jar` |\n| 1.21.11 | `cubecraft-plus-1.3.0+1.21.11.jar` |\n\nRequires [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api). [Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) is optional. Your settings carry over automatically."
		},
