			"notes": "## Added\n- Leaderboard submitting: page through a leaderboard in-game and it's sent to Cubepanion. \n     Can be toggled in `/ccp config` -> `Leaderboard`\n- CubeSocket connection, required for Cubepanion leaderboard submissions to be accepted.\n- Debug mode: `/ccp debug`.\n\n## Minecraft versions\nPick the jar matching your version:\n\n| Jar | Minecraft |\n|---|---|\n| `cubecraft-plus-1.2.0+26.2.jar` | 26.2+ |\n| `cubecraft-plus-1.2.0+26.1.jar` | 26.1 – 26.1.2 |\n| `cubecraft-plus-1.2.0+1.21.11.jar` | 1.21.11+ |\n\nRequires Fabric API. 26.x needs Java 25, 1.21.11 needs Java 21."
		},
